# what every build of simple has: hotreload (haxelib dev hotreload-hx <this repo>, or
# haxelib git), and wgrender-hx (haxelib dev wgrender-hx <its clone>), which compiles
# wgrender in from its sources
-cp src
-lib hotreload-hx
-lib wgrender-hx
--main Main
# 64-bit on every OS: hxcpp builds 32-bit on Windows unless told otherwise
-D HXCPP_M64
-D HXCPP_QUIET